flowchart TB
    users["Organiser · Coordinator · Venue Staff<br/>Technical Support Staff · Attendee<br/>[People]"]
    identity["Supabase Auth<br/>[External System: managed authentication]<br/>Password login, JWT sessions, TOTP MFA"]

    subgraph gather["Gather — software system boundary"]
        web["Web Application<br/>[Container: React / JavaScript, Vite]<br/>Role-specific workspaces, event forms,<br/>registration pages and notification inbox"]
        api["Backend API<br/>[Container: Python / FastAPI, Uvicorn]<br/>Authentication guards, role and ownership checks,<br/>event, venue, equipment and attendee operations"]
        data[("Application Database<br/>[Container: PostgreSQL hosted by Supabase]<br/>Profiles, events, venues, equipment,<br/>bookings, registrations and notifications<br/>Transactional RPCs and notification triggers")]
        web -->|HTTP JSON + bearer JWT; local port 8000| api
        api -->|HTTPS via Supabase Data API / PostgREST; service-role credentials; CRUD and RPC| data
    end

    users -->|Uses browser interface; Vite dev port 5173| web
    web -->|HTTPS via supabase-js; login, refresh and MFA| identity
    api -->|HTTPS via supabase-py; validates bearer token| identity

    classDef person fill:#08427b,color:#fff,stroke:#052e56
    classDef container fill:#1168bd,color:#fff,stroke:#08427b
    classDef external fill:#666,color:#fff,stroke:#444
    class users person
    class web,api,data container
    class identity external
